# Who wrote what.
#
# The agent that works on this repository commits as `pi <pi@local>` unless told
# otherwise, and it was told otherwise partway through: the commits it wrote
# before then are authored by that name. The work is the project maintainer's
# either way, and this file says so without rewriting history — a rewrite would
# orphan the released tags and leave anyone who has cloned with a divergent
# `git log`.
#
# GitHub's contributor statistics read this file, so these commits and the ones
# under the real name are counted together.

